WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.970
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.910
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.980
I can say love

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.710
will you love me?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.500
Hey now!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.800
You don't have to go back to the dorms just because your training's over!

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.540
He doesn't have any choice; it's the rules.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.680
Amane-san. Kiriko-san. Ryoko-san.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.510
Thank you for everything!

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:38.510
Seina-chan...!

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:39.920
Geez...

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.950
I'll leave your room just the way it is, so come visit on your days off!

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.610
Amane! What are you...

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:51.690
Seina-sama! I originally intended to live in the dorms with you,

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.300
but then Airi-sama told me...

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.260
Absolutely not!

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.900
She's so cruel!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.370
Ryoko-san...

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.200
Big Brother.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.840
N- Neige-chan...

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.170
Um, Fuku-chan's...

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.980
I'm sorry, Fuku.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:11.580
I'd like to take you with me, but animals aren't allowed in the dorms.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.770
"Animal"

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.290
Here. This is the hotel I'm staying at.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:19.420
This is a map to my new accommodations.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:22.420
I moved to a new apartment...

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:25.260
Here's my private workstation number.

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.390
Here.

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:28.390
Here!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.770
So it's just as Seto-sama thought...?

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.330
Airi-sama.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:41.210
Understood.

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:59.450
Graduation

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.250
Well then, we'll take these beds for you.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.690
Please do.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:08.020
Preparing to get married, are you? I sure am envious of the lucky man!

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.330
Oh, you're really too much!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.090
Have a nice marriage!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.160
Shopping, shopping...

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:19.870
Toothbrushes, shampoo, and conditioner...

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.970
Whoops, I almost forgot...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.970
"Newlywed Set"

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:31.050
This has nothing to do with that...!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.820
This isn't the reason I came shopping!

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:37.080
It isn't! It isn't!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:41.190
But I should consider that he might come by once in a while...

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.620
Yeah. I should at least congratulate him, shouldn't I?

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.030
Once the graduation ceremony ends...

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.840
The graduation ceremony will be soon...

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.680
And then we can spend his graduation night all alone!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.580
Congratulations!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:06.950
Thank you.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.280
It owe it all to you, Ryoko-san.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.490
It was nothing of the sort...

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.250
Ryoko-san.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.020
Seina-sama.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.420
Ryoko-san!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.030
Oh, Seina-sama...!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.260
You mustn't! Oh, but you did graduate...!

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.860
Oh, Seina-sama!

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.280
Not bad, is it?

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:41.280
This is a bio-droid simulation of what I'll look like in 15 years!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.840
Now let's try this...

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.290
Sorry! Please continue with your lecture!

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.960
Four sneezes in a row?! You got a cold?

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.330
I guess...

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.570
The double bed I've been waiting for!

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:01.570
One bed for two people!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:06.410
Once he graduates we won't be stuck as student and teacher anymore...!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.510
Amane-sensei!

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:11.480
Don't surprise me like that! What is it that's so urgent?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:15.750
I've been trying to call, but you seemed to be enjoying yourself elsewhere.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.980
Chairwoman Airi wants to see you. Be at her office at 1500 hours.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.820
Eh?!

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.960
Our "presence"?

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.460
What do you mean?

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:29.160
The probabilistic variation factor of you four

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:33.940
apparently turns Seina-kun's bad luck vector in the direction of good luck.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:37.540
So basically, when all four of us are together...

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.080
...Seina-kun's bad luck changes into good luck?

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.310
That's crazy talk!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:44.610
Washu-sama, the galaxy's top scientist and researcher of Mihoshi-san,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:48.180
was the one who came to this conclusion!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:51.490
You should understand what she says more than anyone else does.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.290
Well, yeah, but...

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:58.330
But pirates still attacked us even when all four of us were together!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:02.500
But Seina-kun stopped getting hurt all the time like he used to, didn't he?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.100
Now that you mention it, that is true, but...

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.840
And even though you did encounter pirates,

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.740
after all was said and done, you managed to destroy groups like Da Ruma,

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:13.010
so perhaps you could consider his bad luck as extremely good luck?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.640
We've examined this information from the GP's point of view,

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:19.810
and we're considering teaming the four of you with Seina-kun

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:23.510
after he graduates from the Academy.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.250
Fuku-chan too, of course.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.930
I'm really sorry!

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:34.380
Is my class that boring? It must be.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.500
Seina Yamada. Chairwoman Airi wishes to see you right away.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.170
Eh? Oh, right!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.260
What's this now?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.850
Don't be so nervous!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.110
Right!

00:06:54.920 --> 00:07:00.820
This is the current Juraian emperor, Azusa Masaki Jurai-sama.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.660
First Lady, Funaho-sama.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.790
Second Lady, Misaki-sama.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:15.870
Um, hello! I am Seina Yamada of the GP Academy!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.930
It is an honor to meet you! And you! And you!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.080
There's no need to be quite that respectful.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.310
Have a seat.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.680
Y-yes!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.050
Begin.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.920
Yes, Father.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:15.530
As a result of Juraian and GP studies of its structure on the atomic level,

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:21.090
we've learned that this "Statue" was created billions of years ago.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.410
Billions of years ago...?!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:25.510
That's right.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:29.510
And from its age, we've also determined that it was not created

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:32.910
by the Wau people that live on that planet now.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.280
So it was made by an advanced prehistoric civilization...

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.950
This is the inner structure of the Statue.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:43.290
We believe the computer unit is located here,

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.660
where it also serves as the energy generator.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.000
I think I can see where this is going.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:55.970
Just as you've surmised, a bud of a royal tree was placed inside it.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:59.970
That would explain why it was able to create Light Hawk Wings...

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.980
But Jurai hasn't existed that long.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:07.220
I immediately went and asked Sasa... I mean Tsunami-sama about it,

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:10.620
and apparently humanoids similar to us once visited Jurai,

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:13.220
and she gave them two royal tree seeds.

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.420
The one inside that unit is one of those two.

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:19.880
So then that tree is a first generation one?

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.400
Um...

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.990
Do you have a question, Seina-kun?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:31.570
Is it all right for me to be here? It's just that...

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:32.810
Seina-dono.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.810
Y-yes?

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:37.080
The Statue responded to nobody else but you.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.840
Which means that you are the master of that royal tree!

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:46.950
Do you realize what that means? You are 3rd in line to be Juraian emperor!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.010
Eh?

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:52.450
Eh?!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:06.640
Airi. Could you warn Yosho about this?

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:08.180
Fortunately, he isn't the kind of man

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:11.950
who would start a dispute over who's to take the throne.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:15.850
And the other girls certainly are in for a surprise.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:17.480
Right, Seto-sama?

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:21.120
The old hag has him under her control now...

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.460
I feel terrible for him.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:25.390
There's nothing he can do in his situation.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:29.960
Why not give him some training and strategic advice, Azusa-chan?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:33.940
Or would you rather have him be one of the victims?

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:37.410
But he's not the kind of boy who can decide so easily,

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:40.810
so we'll need to conduct an attitude survey on the girls!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.240
Right?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.010
Me?! I should've known...

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.960
In line for Juraian throne...

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.530
It just doesn't feel real...

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:04.770
You look pretty stressed out, guy.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:05.830
Eh?

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:08.500
Just leave it to me to get rid of your worries!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.170
Come on!

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.500
Hey, wait...!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:13.370
I see... So the Statue's...

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:17.510
We think it might be related to an advanced prehistoric civilization.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:19.880
A royal tree...?

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:22.150
I wonder what Seina-san will do...

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.120
There's nobody to tease,

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:28.360
and there's no need to call him Big Brother anymore, is there?

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.720
You have a point.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.160
So, what do you think?

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:35.860
Seina-san quitting the GP...

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:37.330
I can't even imagine it.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:41.370
If he did, I would still support him as a crew member of the Kamidake

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.540
exactly like I have been doing this entire time.

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.310
As a crewmember?

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:46.570
Yes.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:53.580
If I hadn't met him, I'd be living in isolation for the rest of my life,

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:57.850
and I don't think as much about him as much as the other girls do.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:59.550
So that's all I would want.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:03.090
Get ready ladies, 'cuz here we come!

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:05.990
Let's go here!

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:10.770
W-what's goin' on? I got a bad feeling about this...

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.600
NB-sama!

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:15.840
It must be fate that we met up here!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:18.500
It's been so long, let me have a kiss!

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.810
Sorry to keep you waiting, Airi-sama.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.310
Thanks.

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.750
Is that from the first time you met Seina-kun?

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:32.220
Yes. Meeting people can be very strange...

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.190
I was an enemy pirate when we first met...

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:38.590
Then Seina-sama rescued me, and before I knew it, I was a princess.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.530
I still remember that...

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:45.430
So what brings you here today, Airi-sama?

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:50.970
Well, to put it plainly, I'd like to hear what your plans for the future are.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:55.240
Just as Mikami-sama said before, I'll be on the Kamidake...

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:58.580
That's simply the wish of the GP.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:01.680
You are the great-granddaughter of the king of Balouta,

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:05.590
and if Seina-kun officially becomes a member of the royal family,

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.160
we might want to strengthen the relationship between both nations by...

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.060
You can't be serious!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:13.860
I said before that I can't go back with my great-grandfather...

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:18.300
I simply cannot imagine Seina-sama quitting the GP!

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:22.040
So even if there's some distance between the two of us,

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:26.170
I would still be happy just being with him!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:30.800
I would do nothing but serve Seina-sama for the rest of my life!

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:34.450
I'm sorry for all the trouble this big dummy has caused you!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.080
Bye.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.550
No, stop...!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:42.680
Come to think of it, where am I anyway?

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.630
Welcome.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.660
What happened to all of your regular cheerfulness?

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.730
I'm the same as I always am.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.100
Now that I think about it,

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:56.100
weren't you the one who first brought Seina-kun to the GP Academy?

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.410
Yeah.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:00.580
You yelled at me and I missed my chance to be a 1st-class detective.

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:03.910
If you still want to become one, I can write you a recommendation letter.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.750
Your achievements merit it, after all.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:10.220
Thanks, but I think I would be more interested in helping Seina out.

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:11.690
I enjoy it.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.020
Really?

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.460
I suddenly crave some food to go along with this wine!

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:16.860
Would you make something?

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:20.530
Me? For you? But I suck at cooking...

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.190
I like to have bad-tasting things once in a while.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:28.470
I'm obviously not as good a cook as...

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:30.500
Huh?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.100
Maybe she's in the bathroom...?

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.410
It's a double bed!

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.980
What's with this room?!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.970
Are you playing newlywed or something?

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.650
Respect people's privacy!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:42.450
Are you mad?

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:43.440
You bet l...

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:48.620
W-why you...!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.460
I wonder what else you have? Time to check!

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:52.690
Hey, wait!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:56.790
- Over here! - I said wait!

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:01.800
You can't keep up with me anymore?

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:04.470
S-shut up...

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.240
What's the deal? I thought you were young!

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.270
And what's the deal with playing newlywed?

00:15:13.110 --> 00:15:15.550
Oh, it wasn't real?

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.640
Well excuse me for loving him...

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:26.160
Don't tell me that you actually...

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:29.560
Sorry, I just moved so I don't have much...

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.700
Thanks. Please don't fuss yourself over me.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:35.870
I think I told you earlier, but the Statue is considered a Juraian ship.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.970
And a 1st-generation one, on top of that.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:40.440
That means Seina-chan will be exposed to the same dangers

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.340
as other members of the royal family, doesn't it?

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.850
I was part of the Airai family once,

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:48.980
and even though I was never in much danger, I did have guards to escort me.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:50.720
I see...

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.310
So what will you do?

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:57.890
Seina-chan would never quit the GP,

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.560
so naturally I'll support him to the utmost of my abilities

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.860
as a member of the Kamidake's crew.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.230
Well, that's all of you...

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.100
Huh?

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:09.370
Oh, nothing. Just talking to myself.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:13.140
Even though things might get even more dangerous than before,

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:15.380
you won't try to tell him to return to Earth?

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:18.580
Even if I did, he wouldn't listen to me.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.850
And besides, I'm not qualified to tell him anyway...

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:23.920
Qualified...?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:29.420
I kept telling him to go back before he underwent body enhancement.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.290
I believed I was doing it for his sake.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:38.030
Seina-chan and my brother Kai first met in kindergarten.

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:40.500
He's had bad luck since he was a little boy,

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.000
and that bad luck would affect other people around him,

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.540
so all the mothers told their children to stay away from him.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:48.280
As a result, he was always alone.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:52.110
Having bad luck at such a young age probably is dangerous...

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:56.650
We belonged to the Masaki family, so we weren't as vulnerable as most,

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:59.120
and Kai had an easy-going personality...

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.890
They must have hit it off,

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.990
because he started bringing Seina-chan home all the time.

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:08.520
So then you started taking care of him as if he were your own brother...

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.770
Seina-chan's mother was probably used to it,

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:18.010
but she would just say, "Oh well," every time he got hurt.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:24.510
But once, when she came to see my parents for the first time,

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:30.280
she was so happy that Seina-chan had finally made a friend that she cried.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:34.090
I saw it all...

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:37.260
Even after going into space and becoming Seto-sama's assistant,

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:39.730
all the while knowing that I could never return to Earth,

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:41.530
Seina-chan was always...

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:42.830
...on your mind.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:46.100
I don't blame you for wanting to send him back to Earth.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:51.210
But I was being selfish more than anything else...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:55.510
I thought I understood Seina-chan more than anyone...

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.510
I thought I worried about him more than anyone...

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.450
But...

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:05.520
...it was Seto-sama who first told him that his luck was needed!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.220
When I heard that, I...

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:16.560
I realized I treated him like a dangerous bad luck object like everyone else!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:21.940
Kiriko-chan. You were clearly the one who was most worried about him.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:23.530
But...!

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:27.470
Seto-sama was never with him as much as you were.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.810
Don't take it so hard.

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:32.450
No matter how hard things may get along the way,

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:35.620
if it comes to a happy conclusion, then it was all good.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.080
So don't cry...

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:42.460
Yep...

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.220
Carrying out my original intentions...

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.860
Oh, Seina-sama!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:53.230
If I confessed my love to you now it would ruin the balance!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:58.510
Seina-dono's bad luck is going to be more life threatening than ever.

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:02.840
But if doing so would put your life in danger I'd give up and let you go!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:08.420
I'd use that dumb NB to fill the hole in my heart!

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.750
These things I prepared for you will go to waste...

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.050
You're annoying!

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:14.720
Next time please do the survey yourself!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.760
I do apologize.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:20.490
But I can't really ask those girls such questions, now can I?

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:24.670
Maybe if we can get Mikami-sama to ask them...

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.220
Here are the results of the survey!

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:30.770
Come on, what's the problem?!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.930
All four people wanting to back out...?!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.940
Is everyone here?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.910
Tomorrow's the graduation ceremony, so get some rest tonight.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.070
Right!

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:45.490
We all step out into the real world tomorrow...

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.020
We won't be able to do stupid stuff anymore...

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.160
Nope...

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.260
But tonight we're still students!

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:53.090
- Time to break outta here! - As students!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.120
You serious?!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:08.410
Congratulations to all on graduating!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:12.850
From this day forth, you are all official members of the GP!

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:16.950
Please fight for justice in each of your own special ways!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:21.220
But you better not screw up and do anything to embarrass us!

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:24.880
This concludes the graduation ceremony.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.800
Why's there a race after the graduation ceremony?!

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.300
After the graduation ceremony comes the graduation party!

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:41.480
The first one to the party's allowed to get a kiss from the Miss GP girls!

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.310
And after that you get to go on a hot date with them!

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.610
That island?!

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:54.050
What the heck is that?!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:56.190
I prepared some stuff for this day, too!

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.660
Missiles away!

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.360
Not again!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.770
Say, Mikami-sensei...

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:13.170
What in the world is this about...?

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:15.770
You'll have to wait until we arrive to find out!

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:23.120
Just a little farther...!

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:24.720
I refuse to lose...!

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.950
As a man, I must keep...

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:34.290
Ow...!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.630
What's going on?!

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:37.160
Congratulations!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.560
You're this year's number one!

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:43.900
Why?!

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:47.240
Y-you're the next...?

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:49.010
Great-grandfather...?

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:51.250
Old man...?!

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.440
What are you three doing here?!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.940
You're finally here, I see.

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:04.020
W-what's going on?

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:05.820
Something wonderful.

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...


00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.110
I finally graduated from the GP Academy.

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:35.210
Now I'm an official member of the GP!

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:36.950
Now that my first mission is over...

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:39.780
Eh? Hold on a sec! Is this for real?!

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:41.880
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:45.650
The final episode - Lunar Vows
